      "writtenOn": "2023-05-01T03:58:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As discussed offline, this probably needs another field to indicate the kind of offload to do (reply to queries, or let queries through, or let replies through). Otherwise APF which would have capabilities to filter queries and replies wouldn\u0027t know if it needs to let through the queries, or the replies.\n\nMaybe something like \"final long mOffloadType\" which would match OFFLOAD_CAPABILITY_* ?",
